            "review_title": "Review at Mr.C's Speakeasy Pub",
            "review_text": "repco79\nJimboomba, Australia26 contributions\n0\nThe best wood fire stone pizzas in town ! If in Vung Tau they are a must 💝\nFeb 2026 • Family\nThe best Pizza in Vung Tau is here! Randy the owner from Canada makes the most amazing food be it Pizza BBQ Wings Ribs, Mac & Cheese .\nSo if you want to enjoy a pizza with lots of toppings and made in a wood fire oven go here!! \nThanks for having us again and we will see you again next time and little lucky. 😋 Thanks to the waitress staff as well they work hard and are great and are really nice we personally always give them a tip.\nRead more\nWritten February 27, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
