            "review_title": "Review at Mr.C's Speakeasy Pub",
            "review_text": "Daryl S\n41 contributions\n0\nA nice gathering place with excellent woodfired pizza and ribs.\nFeb 2025 • Friends\nRandy and Tam have created this wonderful little pub style bar that happens to make the best pizza I have had in Vietnam. Being Canadian, Randy is happy to open early when important hockey games are on television at 7 or 8 in the morning to accommodate people who also love the game. We met many wonderful people here, and Randy even took us to a great pickleball facility nearby for some exercise. If you miss some North American cuisine and commeraderie , this is a breath of fresh air.\nRead more\nWritten February 25, 2025",
