            "review_text": "Sarah D\nSydney, Australia10 contributions\n0\nDo not miss this place if in town!\nDec 2024 • Couples\nWhat a great experience we had here. 2 years in a row, back to the same place, for drinks and a feed. Great atmosphere, great prices, even greater pizza!!! Thanks Randy and team for a wonderful few nights visiting Vung Tau, you made our stay so welcoming! Do not miss this place if you are in town!\nWritten January 9, 2025",
