            "review_text": "Scenic23914967401\n2 contributions\n0\nBest pizza. A must with kids.\nApr 2024 • Family\nIt’s was our final dinner with my dad before he and his wife left for the uk. My 11 and 8 year old girls just loved it. Relaxed atmosphere and the best pizza. Randy even let the girls make their pizza with him (after they’d washed their hands). \n\nThanks for a lovely evening.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 11, 2024",
